0001 of that Claim) and unit (context.answer_unit). Ratios answering a percentage question must actually be multiplied by 100 before Final; changing the printed value/unit is not an executed conversion. citations must be unique and exactly the answer Claim's lineage. No host arithmetic repair.\",\"reason_limit\":\"Action reason: at most 480 characters; subgoal: at most 240 characters.\",\"state_id\":\"Copy state.id exactly for every submission.\",\"verification_scope\":\"Intermediate validity is numeric and source-lexical, not correct financial use. Final must establish the original question's financial target with source-anchored algebra, not just coincidentally match its number. Alternative arithmetic grouping is permitted. Unsupported alternative evidence equivalences can remain outside this bounded oracle.\"},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request.v2\",\"state\":{\"action_count\":3,\"claims\":[{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:fb515d381e96a3b32498c2254f51d2559b23af7ec449df849d19590bf849538c\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"3581\",\"expression\":\"source:t1c1n0\",\"financial_target_certified\":false,\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim:f0a18cf4c2bd109d2fc112d58b6fa2364e72ad3e5db7bfbb23674598ae7e6fb8\",\"lineage\":[\"source:t1c1n0\"],\"observation_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_observation:990607c15c19daba1ae4315b6e12970565afeace84730ae7290da1ee0203ff29\",\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim.v2\",\"session_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_finqa_registration:bc20dee44ddf77b78b9bef6ec753ccd4d02ce995b7e93dd542a9854a607131fe\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"value\":\"3581\"},{\"accepted_by_request_id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:79d5ff164a8f907d5a54c291e8a19f3921cfa2ebe2a8a6695eb952a750aa9df4\",\"claim_type\":\"numeric_derivation\",\"exact_value\":\"21813\",\"expression\":\"source:t9c1n0\",\"financial_target_certified\":false,\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_claim:5dc94ab956989e2ee16c40df6230764adf1d2ed726be8c2b8503c49e5